# Ymir is not a language GitHub's Linguist knows about (no grammar/entry
# upstream), so .yr files render as plain text by default. Alias them to
# Rust's grammar for readable syntax highlighting on github.com — closest
# available match (let/mut, -> , !{} templates, use imports) but not exact,
# and this also makes .yr count as Rust in the repo's Languages bar/stats.
*.yr linguist-language=Rust
